  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save 200 Children From Sex Trafficking in Delhi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It is estimated that half a million children are trafficked for sex into India&apos;s red-light districts. Raising funds is crucial to provide hope and support to these innocent lives. iPartner India is determined to continue partnering with Society for Participatory Integrated Development (SPID), which works tirelessly in Delhi&apos;s red-light area. Due to the loss of donations during COVID-19, funds are urgently needed to provide education and empowerment for these vulnerable children.</narrative>
  </description>
